{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17750","headline":"送陈判官罢举赴江外 · 杨巨源","name":"送陈判官罢举赴江外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"练思多时冰雪清，拂衣无语别书生。\n莫将甲乙爲前累，不废烟霄是此行。\n定爱红云燃楚色，应看白雨打江声。\n心期玉帐亲台位，魏勃因君说姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}